This is a deep model for LiGePS system, download from https://www.aissquare.com/models/detail?name=LiGePS-SSE-PBEsol-model&id=34&pageType=models. 
For more details, see Huang, Jianxing, et al. "Deep potential generation scheme and simulation protocol for the Li10GeP2S12-type superionic conductors." 
The Journal of Chemical Physics 154.9 (2021): 094703.
